<blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>更改commit message</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 修改最新commit的message</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>git commit --amend -m <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;new message&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># A&lt;-B-C-D 修改C的commit message， git rebase 界面直接先将pick改为r之后保存进入reword编辑界面修改message退出即可</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>git rebase -i C^  <span style="color:#75715e"># git rebase -i D</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div>]]></content><category scheme="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/git" term="git" label="git"/></entry></feed>